cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the software version and the relevant experiment protocol separately."
type: software
title: "RotorVibe: Composable Rotating-Machine Vibration Analysis"
version: 0.1.0a1
date-released: 2026-11-04
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Ugwiyeon
repository-code: "https://github.com/lyullee/rotorvibe"
url: "https://github.com/lyullee/rotorvibe"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23937890
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python vibration analysis and composable diagnostic research APIs with explicit
  signal contracts, normal-reference scope, original-file evaluation evidence and
  documented transfer failures. The public release omits standards lookup tables,
  external raw data and trained rig-specific profiles. It is not field-certified
  fault diagnosis or an automatic protection system.
keywords:
  - vibration analysis
  - rotating machinery
  - bearing kinematics
  - condition monitoring
  - reproducible research
